AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::setOracle()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when new oracle is zero address
│   └── it should revert with AltoBaseMarketInvalidInput
└── when owner supplies a nonzero oracle
    ├── it should update oracle and emit SetOracle with old and new addresses
    └── when new oracle equals current oracle
        └── it should still emit and leave the same value
